values ('71dc9833-bd13-4262-b7be-be1889b81c3f','Hablar de experiencias pasadas','Narrate completed events, connect actions in sequence, and begin distinguishing completed events from background information.','["Use high-frequency time expressions and sequencing phrases","Form regular preterite verbs","Narrate a short past experience"]'::jsonb,1,true)
